---
/**
 * The loading screen: equal light-grey squares filling the window under the
 * header, one or two to a row at the index tiles' size and places, each
 * fading in and out at its own random pace. Hidden until a page asks for it:
 * the case page while it loads (data-reveal), the index while it hands over
 * to a case (data-leaving).
 * Styles in case.css (Entrance). Twelve fill a tall window.
 */
---

<div class="index-grid loading-squares" aria-hidden="true">
  {Array.from({ length: 12 }, () => <div />)}
</div>
